              "id": "modelling_plan",
              "name": "Modelling plan (for Blender / engine agents)",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "COVE LIGHT — MODELLING PLAN (surface draft; to be refined)\nMetres unless stated; values in braces are this object's parameters. Z up, floor at Z 0. Hosted on a wall segment: local X runs along the segment, origin at its midpoint on the centre-line.\n\nWHAT IT IS\nconcealed perimeter wash, no visible source, warm and even\n\nGEOMETRY\nModel the object described above as clean, closed meshes with real thickness and small bevels on exposed edges (about 2 mm) so highlights catch. Drive every dimension from these parameters:\n- Run length: {length}\n- Cove depth from the wall: {coveDepth}\n- Cove board thickness: {boardThk}\n- Lip height: {lipHeight}\n- Lip thickness: {lipThk}\n- Slab soffit: {slabHeight}\n- Cove below the slab: {coveDrop}\n- Tape set back from the lip: {tapeSetback}\n- Tape width: {stripWidth}\n- Colour rendering index: {cri}\n- Dim level (%): {dimLevel}\n- Lamp radius (soft shadow): {lampRadius}\n- Export a lamp (off = geometry only): {emitsLight}\n- Light group gain: {lightGroupGain}\n- Rotation (deg): {rotation}\n- Anchor Direction: {anchorDir} (one of: Top-Left / Top-Center / Top-Right / Left-Center / Center / Right-Center / Bottom-Left / Bottom-Center / Bottom-Right)\n- Margin from host: {margin}\n- Flip side: {flipSide}\nKeep the proportions of a well-made real product; add the secondary detail a close-up render needs (joints, reveals, fixings) but no hidden interior geometry.\n\nMATERIALS\n- Base colour: {baseColor}\n- Roughness: {roughness}\nPrincipled BSDF per visible part, using the colour and roughness above for the main surface; secondary parts in a neutral complementary finish. Use Object / box-projected texture coordinates (no UVs needed). Add a subtle noise bump (strength ~0.03) so surfaces are not perfectly flat.\n\nLIGHTS\nThis object emits light. Use these values:\n- Output per metre: {lumensPerMetre}\n- Colour temperature: {kelvin}\n- Warm dim floor: {dimToKelvin}\n- Draw the lit surface: {showEmissiveSurface}\nPlace the emitter where the real lamp or LED sits, make the diffuser / bulb surface emissive to match, and hide the emitter itself from camera where a real fitting would conceal it.\n\nCHECKS (measure after building)\n- Run length = {length}\n- Cove depth from the wall = {coveDepth}\n- Lip height = {lipHeight}\n- Slab soffit = {slabHeight}\n- Cove below the slab = {coveDrop}\n- Tape width = {stripWidth}\n- Lamp radius (soft shadow) = {lampRadius}\n- All meshes closed, no duplicate faces, origin as stated above.",
